{"team":"CHI","col":"#F1873B","identity":"run-heavy","funnel":"run-funnel","plays_pg":64.3,"adot":8.5,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>A Ground-First Machine</h2><p>The WR2 is unusually involved here \u2014 <strong>19%</strong> of targets (league ~15%), meaning there's bankable volume beyond the top receiver.</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>Their run game attacks the perimeter \u2014 <strong>31% of carries hit the edge</strong> (league ~25%), an outside-zone lean that rewards speed backs and can boom for chunk gains.</p><p>They're a heavy under-center team (61% shotgun vs ~68%) \u2014 a pro-style, run-committed structure.</p><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 58% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><p>They play fast \u2014 <strong>64 snaps a game</strong> (league ~61), and the extra volume is a rising tide that lifts everyone's counting stats.</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Their red-zone identity is <strong>run-first</strong> (52% pass), funnelling touchdown equity to <strong>D'Andre Swift</strong>.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 Soft on the Ground</h2><p>They surrender <strong>134 rushing</strong> and <strong>239 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). The run moves against them \u2014 <strong>target opposing RB1s</strong>.</p><p>They give up deep shots (21% of throws travel 15+ vs ~19%) \u2014 big-play WR upside against them.</p><p>They leak <strong>RB rushing TDs</strong> (0.56/game vs ~0.46) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><p>They leak <strong>WR1 receiving TDs</strong> (0.47/game vs ~0.38) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: back <strong>D'Andre Swift</strong>'s rushing volume in favored/positive scripts; their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs); <strong>opposing RB1s</strong> smash on the ground and at the goal line.</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Caleb Williams","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":7,"props":{"Comp":19.64,"Att":32.77,"Pass Yds":219.04,"Pass TD":1.34,"INT":0.45,"Rush Yds":20.83}},{"name":"Tyson Bagent","slot":"QB2","starter":false,"td":13,"props":{"Comp":2.13,"Att":3.21,"Pass Yds":20.41,"Pass TD":0.09,"INT":0.26,"Rush Yds":8.09}}],"RB":[{"name":"D'Andre Swift","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":31,"props":{"Rush Att":11.84,"Rush Yds":52.26,"Tgt":2.33,"Rec":1.84,"Rec Yds":13.79}},{"name":"Kyle Monangai","slot":"RB2","starter":true,"td":22,"props":{"Rush Att":7.75,"Rush Yds":33.92,"Tgt":2.81,"Rec":2.02,"Rec Yds":17.58}},{"name":"Roschon Johnson","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":15,"props":{"Rush Att":1.57,"Rush Yds":6.08,"Tgt":1.73,"Rec":1.21,"Rec Yds":8.14}},{"name":"Salvon Ahmed","slot":"RB4","starter":false,"td":14,"props":{"Rush Att":2.43,"Rush Yds":7.86,"Tgt":2.8,"Rec":1.73,"Rec Yds":12.92}}],"WR":[{"name":"Rome Odunze","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":21,"props":{"Tgt":5.04,"Rec":2.72,"Rec Yds":37.4,"Rec TD":0.23}},{"name":"Luther Burden III","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":17,"props":{"Tgt":4.38,"Rec":3.05,"Rec Yds":39.82,"Rec TD":0.18}},{"name":"Kalif Raymond","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":7,"props":{"Tgt":2.27,"Rec":1.42,"Rec Yds":17.62,"Rec TD":0.07}},{"name":"Zavion Thomas","slot":"WR4","starter":false,"td":10,"props":{"Tgt":2.26,"Rec":1.25,"Rec Yds":15.09,"Rec TD":0.1}},{"name":"Jahdae Walker","slot":"WR5","starter":false,"td":16,"props":{"Tgt":2.99,"Rec":1.92,"Rec Yds":24.8,"Rec TD":0.18}}],"TE":[{"name":"Colston Loveland","slot":"TE1","starter":true,"td":35,"props":{"Tgt":8.0,"Rec":5.47,"Rec Yds":67.25,"Rec TD":0.45}},{"name":"Cole Kmet","slot":"TE2","starter":false,"td":13,"props":{"Tgt":2.91,"Rec":1.84,"Rec Yds":18.5,"Rec TD":0.14}},{"name":"Sam Roush","slot":"TE3","starter":false,"td":11,"props":{"Tgt":2.26,"Rec":1.39,"Rec Yds":13.94,"Rec TD":0.12}}]},"s